      "created_at": "2014-12-13T15:27:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/48/5774_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>jffdougan wrote:</b><br>\n<blockquote>If'n you can find it secondhand, what about Crossbows &amp; Catapults?\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n<p>I still have two of their sets (don’t remember the names) in the garage. It’s a fun little game! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a295882623359b2efcf3242c602dc5a15ccbb68e.gif\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"nchIGjrCD2ydeKFOxqHOVH9DOiO\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">The trebuchet is sitting on my desk at the office. Turns out it works great for hurling Skittles (and similar candies) to waiting teammates. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/98c9cb3c8e221c0d0ee2f1a249444dbc3926ca3d.gif\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"lNCUQFYSA7ZMqVCMtPuFwzz40RT\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">Shame I no longer work with teammates who enjoy that kind of fun. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5996dbb474c88b8f9fc49f09dc3858d081055a2d.gif\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"cMxHQaDq0kbGxwGJQa30HupNF6d\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Are you hiring? A Skittles catapult is a pretty awesome incentive!</p>",
